Report the PC of a triggered breakpoint instead of its index.

The breakpoint-hit message in debug() prints "Breakpoint at %x" (the PC)
rather than "Breakpoint %d triggered" (the breakpoint number).

Index: demoscene-toolchain/submodules/amiberry/src/debug.cpp
===================================================================
--- demoscene-toolchain.orig/submodules/amiberry/src/debug.cpp
+++ demoscene-toolchain/submodules/amiberry/src/debug.cpp
@@ -8335,7 +8335,7 @@ void debug (void)
 				return;
 			}
 			if (bpnum >= 0) {
-				console_out_f(_T("Breakpoint %d triggered.\n"), bpnum);
+				console_out_f(_T("Breakpoint at %x\n"), pc);
 			}
 			debug_cycles(1);
 		}
